| Name       | Text                                                                                       | Runtime                          | Goal Type       | Target Condition/Enquired Information | Relation |
|------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------|-----------------|----------------------------------------|----------|
| **G1**     | Execute Resource Collection and Delivery Mission                                         | -                                 | Perform Goal    | Mission executed successfully           | -        |
| **G2**     | Collect Required Resources from Storage                                                  | -                                 | Perform Goal    | Resources collected successfully         | AND      |
| **G3**     | Deliver Collected Resources to the Specified Location                                    | -                                 | Perform Goal    | Resources delivered successfully          | AND      |
| **G4**     | Handle Battery Constraints During Collection Phase                                       | -                                 | Perform Goal    | Battery constraints managed successfully | AND      |
| **G5**     | Handle Battery Constraints During Delivery Phase                                        | -                                 | Perform Goal    | Battery constraints managed successfully | AND      |
| **G6**     | Handle Resource Failure During Delivery Phase                                            | -                                 | Perform Goal    | Resource failure handled successfully     | AND      |
| **G7**     | Assign Multiple Robots for Parallel Collection-Delivery Tasks                            | -                                 | Perform Goal    | Multiple robots assigned successfully     | AND      |

